OL,3,GNEWSACouncil blames developer over     
OL,4,Aschool opening delay                   
OL,6,FThe opening date for a new primary     
OL,7,Fschool has been pushed back, with the  
OL,8,Flocal council blaming a housing        
OL,9,Fdeveloper.                             
OL,11,FHenley Gate Primary School had been due
OL,12,Fto open on the outskirts of Ipswich in 
OL,13,FSeptember next year.                   
OL,15,FHowever, Suffolk County Council said it
OL,16,Fwould postpone the opening until       
OL,17,FSeptember 2028, because developer Crest
OL,18,FNicholson only handed over control of  
OL,19,Fthe site this month instead of in      
OL,20,FSeptember 2025 as expected.            
